OL,3,AGirl, 6, dies after family killed in
OL,4,Asea off Shoreham
OL,5,
OL,6,FA six-year-old girl has died in
OL,7,Fhospital after getting into difficulty
OL,8,Fin the sea off Shoreham in West Sussex,
OL,9,Fin an incident which also killed her
OL,10,Ffather, mother and sister.
OL,12,FSaja El-Khawas, a British Palestinian
OL,13,Ffrom London, was pulled from the sea by
OL,14,Femergency crews on Tuesday.
OL,16,FHer father Hassan El-Khawas, 55, mother
OL,17,FZeina Alayn, 37, and 14-year-old sister
OL,18,FSara, died despite the efforts of
OL,19,Fparamedics at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
