OL,3,ARussian strikes on Ukraine kill two,
OL,4,Aofficials say, a day after deadly
OL,5,Aattack on mall
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least two people have been killed in
OL,8,FUkraine by Russian strikes, local
OL,9,Fauthorities said early on Saturday,
OL,10,Fwhile nine people remain missing a day
OL,11,Fafter a double-tap attack on a shopping
OL,12,Fcentre that killed 16.
OL,14,FLocal authorities said one person was
OL,15,Fkilled in a warehouse fire in Kyiv
OL,16,Fafter an alert for a ballistic missile
OL,17,Fwhile another was killed in a drone
OL,18,Fstrike on the city of Zaporizhzhia.
OL,20,FThe attacks follow a deadly Russian
OL,21,Fdouble-tap drone strike on a busy mall
OL,22,Fin the city of Kryvyi Rih on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
