OL,3,ARussian strikes on Ukraine kill two,
OL,4,Aofficials say, a day after deadly
OL,5,Aattack on mall
OL,6,
OL,7,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky said the
OL,8,F"absolutely cynical and despicable"
OL,9,Fdaytime attack in his home town was
OL,10,Fcarried out in "two waves", with the
OL,11,Fsecond strike targeting emergency
OL,12,Fworkers.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
